  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue: \n\nIn the Quick Menu you can view the Stats of the Avatar you are currently wearing by clicking on `Avatar` in the Profile Wing. \n\nThis does not work when you already have the Avatar Stats of another User open however, there it will just refresh the currently open Avatar Stats.\n\n**Reproduction Steps:** \n\n1. Open the QM and go to the Here Tab\n\n2. Click on someones Profile\n\n3. Click on \"View Avatar Details\"\n\n4. Open the Profile Wing\n\n5. Click on \"Avatar\"\n\nIf you do this you will notice that the page just refreshes but is not actually opening your own Avatar Stats.\n\n# Expected Behavior:\n\nWhen you already have the Avatar Stats from someone else open, clicking on \"Avatar\" in the Profile Wing should just close that persons Avatar Stats and open your own.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/6ybway.mp4",
